     Typing error: This function's body has grade `[{(ReadTouch; SendBeat;
       !10.5)*; (ReadTouch | 0); (0 | SendArm; !12.5; ShowTextAt; ...`,
       which does not match its annotated grade `[{((ReadTouch; SendBeat;
       !10.5)*; (ReadTouch | 0); (SendArm; !12.5)^20; ShowTextAt; ...`
       ...
*)
