   reading is no longer the latest:

     Typing error: Variable `latest` is unboxed with grade `[{ReadTouch;
       ReadImu}, {ReadTouch; ReadImu}]` accumulated since it was bound, which
       is not below its box grade `[{(!_ & ~ReadImu)*}, {(!_ & ~ReadImu)*}]`
       ...
*)
